title: Infoblox: Platform managed service status
agents: infoblox_csp
catalog: cloud/infoblox
license: GPLv2
distribution: mkp
description:
 Reports the status of a platform managed service on a NIOS-X server. The
 portal presents these separately from deployed services and uses a
 different set of status values, so they are checked separately.

 The service is {OK} while the status is online, {WARN} when degraded and
 {CRIT} when in error or offline. Every mapping is configurable.

 Note that Application Management reports no version, so version
 information is absent rather than empty for that item.

discovery:
 One service is created for each platform managed service, in practice
 Platform Management and Application Management.

item:
 The service type as Infoblox names it in the portal, either Platform
 Management or Application Management.
